    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8106" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">circo</span></b> , āre, 1, v. a.
		circus. = circumeo. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To go about</i>, <i>traverse</i>:
			montem, Gromat. Vet. p. 326, 17; v. also circito <i>fin.</i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To wander through</i>: TOTAM REGIONEM, Inscr. ap.
			Hermes, 1, 343.</div>
